      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Sobre el cielo había otro mundo. Allí vivía gente, muy parecida a la de aquí.",
          "en": "Above the sky, there was another world. People lived there, much like people live here."
        },
        {
          "es": "En el centro de ese Mundo del Cielo había un gran árbol.",
          "en": "In the middle of that Sky World stood a great tree."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sus flores daban luz a todos. Allí no había sol: la luz era el árbol mismo.",
          "en": "Its flowers gave light to everyone. There was no sun up there. The tree itself was the light."
        },
        {
          "es": "En muchas versiones, en el Mundo del Cielo nadie se enfermaba y nadie moría.",
          "en": "In many tellings, no one in the Sky World was ever sick, and no one ever died."
        }
      ],
