      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En el Mundo del Cielo vivía una joven. Hoy la llamamos la Mujer del Cielo.",
          "en": "A young woman lived in the Sky World. Today we call her Sky Woman."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se casó con el hombre que cuidaba el gran árbol. En muchas versiones, él era un jefe.",
          "en": "She married the man who looked after the great tree. In many tellings, he was a chief."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pronto, la Mujer del Cielo iba a tener un bebé.",
          "en": "Soon, Sky Woman was going to have a baby."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero algo estaba por cambiar el Mundo del Cielo para siempre.",
          "en": "But something was about to change the Sky World forever."
        }
      ],
