        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La Mujer del Cielo caminó hasta el borde del hoyo y miró hacia abajo.",
          "en": "Sky Woman walked to the edge of the hole and looked down."
        },
        {
          "es": "Muy abajo no vio tierra. Solo agua, oscura y brillante, hasta donde alcanzaba la vista.",
          "en": "Far below, she saw no land at all. Only water, dark and shining, as far as she could see."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces cayó. Algunos dicen que resbaló. Otros, que su esposo la empujó.",
          "en": "Then she fell. Some say she slipped. Some say her husband pushed her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al caer, se agarró del borde. Sus manos se cerraron sobre raíces y semillas del Mundo del Cielo.",
          "en": "As she fell, she grabbed at the edge. Her hands closed around roots and seeds from the Sky World."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Resbaló o la empujaron? ¿Qué crees que pasó ese día?",
          "en": "Did she slip, or was she pushed? What do you think happened that day?"
        }
      ],
