      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Una bandada de gansos voló a su encuentro. En algunas versiones eran cisnes o garzas.",
          "en": "A flock of geese flew up to meet her. In some tellings, they were swans or herons."
        },
        {
          "es": "Volaron ala con ala, tan juntos que sus lomos formaron un colchón de plumas.",
          "en": "They flew wing to wing, so close that their backs made a soft bed of feathers."
        },
        {
          "es": "La Mujer del Cielo cayó sobre sus lomos, y la bajaron despacio hacia el agua.",
          "en": "Sky Woman landed on their backs, and they carried her slowly down toward the water."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero los gansos no podían volar para siempre. ¿Dónde iba a pararse, si no había tierra?",
          "en": "But the geese could not fly forever. Where could she stand, with no land anywhere?"
        }
      ],
